#. module: health_care_command_channels
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/health_care_command_channels/models/channel_golive.py:0
msgid ""
"Open Authentication, then Add a platform, and choose Web. Paste the address "
"below as the redirect URI. It belongs to Odoo's own Outlook integration, and "
"Microsoft refuses the sign-in unless it matches exactly, character for "
"character."
msgstr ""
"Mở Authentication, chọn Add a platform rồi chọn Web. Dán địa chỉ bên dưới "
"làm redirect URI. Địa chỉ này thuộc về tích hợp Outlook của chính Odoo, và "
"Microsoft sẽ từ chối đăng nhập nếu không khớp chính xác từng ký tự."

#. module: health_care_command_channels
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/health_care_command_channels/models/channel_center.py:0
msgid "Open BotFather"
msgstr "Mở BotFather"

#. module: health_care_command_channels
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/health_care_command_channels/models/channel_golive.py:0
msgid ""
"Open Certificates & secrets, then New client secret. Copy the Value column, "
"NOT the Secret ID — that is the classic mistake, and the Value is shown only "
"once. Paste it here; we encrypt it and never show it again. Entra secrets "
"expire after 24 months at the most, so write the expiry date into the note "
"on the platform application while you have it."
msgstr ""
